1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Threatened by a ruthless demon, humanity was on the brink of destruction.

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:16,000
All seemed lost until a lone mage stepped forward and took up the fight.

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:28,000
After his triumph, he was hailed as the Wizard King, and his story became legend.

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:37,000
Aiming to defeat Lit, leader of the Eye of the Midnight Sun, Asta and his fellow royal knights stormed his floating fortress.

5
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Their attack seemed to overwhelm the enemy at first, until...

6
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,000
Seriously, why are we here?

7
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Did I say you could duplicate yourself?

8
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Hey, it's not like the heavy choice it is!

9
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:51,000
Whatever, you're obviously the fake one!

10
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:53,000
You're the fake one and you know it!

11
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Stop yelling!

12
00:00:58,000 --> 00:00:59,000
That's one solution.

13
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:03,000
What's wrong with you? You could've killed me!

14
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:08,000
You survived a trial by fire, and I wouldn't have brought anyone who couldn't.

15
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:14,000
The imposter was none other than Raya the Disloyal, last remaining member of the Third Eye.

16
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:20,000
I'll show you what destruction looks like!

17
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Flame magic!

18
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:24,000
Kalingos Brachium!

19
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Thus began a fierce battle between the powers of flame magic and copy magic.

20
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:41,000
As the fight raged on, the ferocity of Meraleona's attack spells got the better of Raya.

21
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:45,000
Nearby, Yuno's team approached the center of the fortress.

22
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:46,000
Aaaaah!

23
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:51,000
Sorry, but you can't defeat me. You don't have what it takes.

24
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:56,000
Do you hear that?

25
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:58,000
I heard it before, too.

26
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:00,000
A heartbeat.

27
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:03,000
The mana here feels so... familiar.

28
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:12,000
Meanwhile, the Black Bulls celebrate a narrow victory after a surprise attack by the Midnight Sun.

29
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:18,000
We-we managed to fend them off somehow, but what are we supposed to do now that our hideout is in ruins?

30
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:21,000
We won't be inviting those guests back again.

31
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:25,000
Um, Henry? Are you absolutely sure that you can't fix the hideout?

32
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:29,000
Not now. My magic's all spent.

33
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:32,000
What are we going to do, Ghosh?

34
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:37,000
I'm not doing anything until I find my Marie treasures! Now where do they go?!

35
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:42,000
Crushed to bits, I bet. In tiny little pieces.

36
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:45,000
If you're gonna piss me off, at least hurry it up!

37
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:48,000
And while you're at it, get down here and help me, would you?

38
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:49,000
You sure?

39
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:53,000
Get your big, slow-talking mop head off that wall right now!

40
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:55,000
Um, Ghosh? Wait!

41
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:57,000
I wouldn't recommend that, actually.

42
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:58,000
Hurry up!

43
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:00,000
You know...

44
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:03,000
Whatever it is, I don't care! Get down here!

45
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:06,000
Okie-dokie...

46
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:10,000
Was that so hard, you-

47
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:19,000
When Henry gets too close to someone, he sucks all of their power away!

48
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:21,000
I tried to warn you, Ghosh.

49
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:26,000
I found it!

50
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:30,000
Thank goodness you're safe.

51
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:34,000
And look, there's not a scratch on you, not even a speck of-

52
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:35,000
Huh?

53
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:37,000
You've been tainted!

54
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:39,000
I'll kill them all!

55
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:41,000
The Eye of the Midnight Sun is dead!

56
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:44,000
How are you gonna do that? They're all gone.

57
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:47,000
Shut up, or I'll kill you while I'm at it!

58
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:52,000
I'll behave...

59
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:55,000
Give me my magic back!

60
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:56,000
Nope...

61
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:57,000
Can't...

62
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:59,000
