63
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:01,000
I... can't...

64
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:03,000
I'm worried, though.

65
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:07,000
The Eye of the Midnight Sun said they came here looking for something, remember?

66
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:10,000
But we still don't know what that is, or what it might do!

67
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:12,000
Probably just a bluff.

68
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:16,000
The only thing here that's worth anything is my Marie memorabilia.

69
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:19,000
You don't think they were coming from my dolls?

70
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:21,000
I don't think so, guys.

71
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:24,000
Well, if there was something valuable here, then it must be...

72
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:28,000
What do you mean?

73
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:29,000
What was it mean?

74
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:31,000
Forget it, alright?

75
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:35,000
Whatever this is about, Captain Yami can figure it out once he finally decides to come back.

76
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:37,000
I hope so!

77
