I'll see you next time.

99
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:38,380
What are you losers gawkin' at?

100
00:06:44,300 --> 00:06:45,100
Yummy, sir.

101
00:06:45,740 --> 00:06:46,440
That's me.

102
00:06:47,040 --> 00:06:49,260
Would you like some more tea, perhaps?

103
00:06:49,640 --> 00:06:50,360
More tea?

104
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:53,180
Are you trying to drown me in this stuff or what?

105
00:06:53,600 --> 00:06:56,360
Do you know how many times I've had to go to the bathroom today?

106
00:06:56,480 --> 00:06:58,880
It's gonna start pouring out of my ears any minute now.

107
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:01,180
And by the way, is this some kind of herbal bullcrap?

108
00:07:01,240 --> 00:07:03,420
Because it tastes like I've got a pine tree in my mouth.

109
00:07:03,580 --> 00:07:04,860
We're very sorry, sir.

110
00:07:05,660 --> 00:07:09,060
I thought old Goldie Guts called me here to apologize.

111
00:07:09,820 --> 00:07:12,100
What's the big idea making me wait around all day?

112
00:07:12,400 --> 00:07:13,940
How much longer is this gonna take?

113
00:07:14,620 --> 00:07:16,640
I'm sure that he'll be here as soon as possible.

114
00:07:17,260 --> 00:07:18,640
Here's some tea in the meantime.

115
00:07:19,140 --> 00:07:19,920
No, thanks.

116
00:07:20,160 --> 00:07:21,280
Almost had me there.

117
00:07:21,320 --> 00:07:22,680
I bet you think you're clever.

118
00:07:22,820 --> 00:07:23,820
Not at all, sir.

119
00:07:23,820 --> 00:07:28,240
You know, a ride's out of commission at the moment,

120
00:07:28,360 --> 00:07:31,760
so it wasn't exactly convenient to drag my butt all the way out here.

121
00:07:33,100 --> 00:07:34,180
I'll be frank.

122
00:07:34,500 --> 00:07:37,380
I know selection exam battles can get pretty intense,

123
00:07:37,640 --> 00:07:39,920
but that vice-captain of yours was off the rails.

124
00:07:39,920 --> 00:07:42,520
He busted up Finral like nobody's business.

125
00:07:43,300 --> 00:07:46,160
In fact, he's still in the hospital now, knocked out cold.

126
00:07:46,800 --> 00:07:49,800
As you've likely heard, they hauled your boy in for questioning,

127
00:07:50,040 --> 00:07:51,600
but that's going nowhere fast.

128
00:07:51,600 --> 00:07:57,180
If he had any manners, it seems to me your captain would have come to my place

129
00:07:57,180 --> 00:07:59,180
rather than keeping me waiting all day.

130
00:08:00,300 --> 00:08:02,760
You playing me for a fool, Golden Dawn?

131
00:08:03,680 --> 00:08:04,840
He's out for blood.

132
00:08:06,060 --> 00:08:10,220
We simply cannot apologize enough for the way that vice-captain Longris behaved.

133
00:08:10,740 --> 00:08:14,380
That aside, I assure you that Captain Vongens is trustworthy.

134
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:17,240
He's a man of tremendous integrity as well.

135
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:19,300
Whatever his reason for making you wait,

136
00:08:19,300 --> 00:08:21,780
I know he would never be intentionally discourteous.

137
00:08:25,100 --> 00:08:26,580
Okay, who the hell are you?

138
00:08:26,740 --> 00:08:27,720
I'm not an enemy!

139
00:08:27,960 --> 00:08:31,260
You say you're not, but you look pretty shady in that peacock costume of yours.

140
00:08:31,760 --> 00:08:33,440
Yami, I believe your name was.

141
00:08:33,800 --> 00:08:35,120
Watch my back, if you would.

142
00:08:36,200 --> 00:08:36,880
This guy...

143
00:08:36,880 --> 00:08:40,020
He moves like he's able to read my mind or something.

144
00:08:40,860 --> 00:08:43,020
Our key must be on the same wavelength.

145
00:08:44,420 --> 00:08:46,700
How many years has it been since then?

146
00:08:47,300 --> 00:08:49,600
We both became squad captains together.

147
00:08:49,600 --> 00:08:54,640
Well, I'm the kind of guy who goes with his gut instinct.

148
00:08:55,980 --> 00:09:00,140
Vongens, if you don't mind, lose the mask.

149
00:09:01,120 --> 00:09:02,200
I understand, Yami.

150
00:09:02,540 --> 00:09:04,460
You are suspicious of me, aren't you?

151
00:09:04,640 --> 00:09:07,560
You think I might be the leader of the Eye of the Midnight Sun.

152
00:09:07,560 --> 00:09:11,020
There's something about him that I feel in you, too.

153
00:09:11,580 --> 00:09:14,020
So come on, show me your face.

154
00:09:20,360 --> 00:09:23,300
My whole life, they called me a cursed child.

155
00:09:24,840 --> 00:09:27,500
I'm glad I got the chance to show you who I am.

156
00:09:28,200 --> 00:09:28,980
Thank you, Yami.

157
00:09:28,980 --> 00:09:32,800
I didn't have any reason to doubt his sincerity.

158
00:09:33,520 --> 00:09:34,200
Please, sir.

159
00:09:34,660 --> 00:09:35,780
Just a bit longer.

160
00:09:36,320 --> 00:09:37,500
Have faith in the captain.

161
00:09:39,940 --> 00:09:41,060
Yeah, I know.

162
00:09:41,560 --> 00:09:43,420
You don't gotta tell me twice.

163
00:09:45,260 --> 00:09:46,040
Julius, sir.

164
00:09:46,540 --> 00:09:47,460
Are you here, sir?

165
00:09:47,740 --> 00:09:48,800
I need to speak with you.

166
00:09:49,660 --> 00:09:52,320
I take my eyes off him for one second and he runs off.

167
00:09:53,340 --> 00:09:55,040
Show some responsibility for once.

168
00:09:55,100 --> 00:09:55,940
You're the Wizard King.

169
00:09:55,940 --> 00:10:00,020
I'd love to complain about this pile of work he left,

170
00:10:00,300 --> 00:10:02,340
but my transmission magic isn't getting through.

171
00:10:14,960 --> 00:10:18,720
Right now, I'm sure the Royal Knights are fighting their final battle

172
00:10:18,720 --> 00:10:21,720
with the Eye of the Midnight Sun, deep within their hideout.

173
00:10:22,620 --> 00:10:24,740
Of course, I'd love to swoop in and join them,

174
00:10:24,740 --> 00:10:26,480
but I've been watching them long enough

175
00:10:26,480 --> 00:10:28,340
to know that they'll be fine on their own.

176
00:10:29,120 --> 00:10:29,720
Their power,

177
00:10:30,160 --> 00:10:32,120
and their desire to keep this nation safe

178
00:10:32,120 --> 00:10:33,200
will not fail them.

179
00:10:34,200 --> 00:10:36,140
I need only offer them my faith,

180
00:10:36,260 --> 00:10:37,160
even from afar.

181
00:10:38,020 --> 00:10:40,180
Besides, Marks would be furious if I left.

182
00:10:40,180 --> 00:10:44,280
I have my own duty to attend to, after all.

183
00:10:44,800 --> 00:10:45,940
Here and now.

184
00:10:48,060 --> 00:10:50,960
How unusual for you to come to speak with me like this.

185
00:10:52,280 --> 00:10:53,620
What's the occasion, William?

186
00:10:53,620 --> 00:11:01,700
First, I must thank you for taking the time to indulge my selfish request.

187
00:11:05,160 --> 00:11:08,180
From the start, you have acknowledged me for my worth,

188
00:11:08,440 --> 00:11:10,480
even though my appearance is strange.

189
00:11:10,480 --> 00:11:15,020
When I met you, my entire future opened up before me.

190
00:11:15,020 --> 00:11:20,020
I was raised as a cursed child in a poor village,

191
00:11:20,360 --> 00:11:21,320
in the Forsaken Realm.

192
00:11:22,480 --> 00:11:24,140
I suffered such cruel treatment,

193
00:11:24,460 --> 00:11:27,780
even from the family where I had been welcomed as the nobleman's successor.

194
00:11:28,100 --> 00:11:28,680
But then...

195
00:11:28,680 --> 00:11:29,240
Incredible!

196
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:31,140
What was that magic you were just using?

197
00:11:31,860 --> 00:11:33,080
You showed me kindness.

198
00:11:33,760 --> 00:11:35,140
You showed me respect.

199
00:11:35,980 --> 00:11:38,100
You invited me to become a magic knight.

200
00:11:38,100 --> 00:11:39,940
I'm serious.

201
00:11:40,160 --> 00:11:42,540
Your face isn't something you ought to be ashamed of.

202
00:11:42,820 --> 00:11:45,200
However, if it bothers you that much...

203
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:46,520
I'll give you this mask!

204
00:11:49,100 --> 00:11:51,280
When you presented me with this gift,

205
00:11:51,760 --> 00:11:53,620
when you allowed me to join your order,

206
00:11:54,260 --> 00:11:56,080
and everything became certain to me,

207
00:11:56,540 --> 00:11:59,320
I would dedicate my grimoire to you and your cause.

208
00:12:02,500 --> 00:12:04,240
It's been 11 years,

209
00:12:04,520 --> 00:12:06,760
and my sentiments haven't changed one bit.

210
00:12:06,760 --> 00:12:09,380
There's no one in this world

211
00:12:09,380 --> 00:12:11,480
that I respect as much as you.

212
00:12:12,180 --> 00:12:12,920
Uh, yeah.

213
00:12:13,180 --> 00:12:14,760
Where did all this praise come from?

214
00:12:15,160 --> 00:12:16,240
How about that tournament, huh?

215
00:12:17,860 --> 00:12:19,060
Bit by bit,

216
00:12:19,600 --> 00:12:20,780
I climbed the ranks

217
00:12:20,780 --> 00:12:23,080
until I became a magic knight captain.

218
00:12:23,940 --> 00:12:25,100
Guided by my own mana,

219
00:12:25,540 --> 00:12:27,340
I selected talented squad members

220
00:12:27,340 --> 00:12:29,200
and created the Golden Dawn.

221
00:12:30,600 --> 00:12:32,660
As thanks for the kindness you showed me,

222
00:12:33,440 --> 00:12:35,160
I built the strongest squad of knights

223
00:12:35,160 --> 00:12:36,040
that I could assemble.

224
00:12:36,760 --> 00:12:38,180
I did that for you.

225
00:12:39,380 --> 00:12:40,280
But also,

226
00:12:40,980 --> 00:12:43,620
for someone else who is equally dear to me.

227
00:12:46,020 --> 00:12:48,340
A friend who's always been at my side.

228
00:12:48,800 --> 00:12:50,780
One I've known even longer than you.

229
00:12:51,380 --> 00:12:53,500
Now, I'm faced with two loved ones

230
00:12:53,500 --> 00:12:55,640
who desire two very different paths.

231
00:12:55,640 --> 00:12:59,100
I'm torn between the dream that we fought for

232
00:12:59,100 --> 00:13:00,900
and the dream of my dear friend.

233
00:13:01,900 --> 00:13:03,100
I've known from the start

234
00:13:03,100 --> 00:13:05,180
I couldn't possibly choose between you.

235
00:13:06,360 --> 00:13:07,120
So now,

236
00:13:07,440 --> 00:13:10,400
that decision must fall on your shoulders.

237
00:13:11,260 --> 00:13:12,140
It's scars.

238
00:13:12,140 --> 00:13:20,300
William, my only human friend,

239
00:13:20,400 --> 00:13:21,800
I know this was hard for you.

240
00:13:22,140 --> 00:13:22,820
I'm grateful.

241
00:13:23,600 --> 00:13:24,680
Greetings to you,

242
00:13:25,460 --> 00:13:27,680
Wizard King Julius Novakrono.

243
00:13:27,680 --> 00:13:30,860
I am the leader of the Eye of the Midnight Sun.

244
00:13:31,600 --> 00:13:32,660
Known as Lit.

245
00:13:33,780 --> 00:13:35,420
I have dreaded this day.

246
00:13:36,240 --> 00:13:37,320
Yet here we are.

247
00:13:37,320 --> 00:13:48,340
William,

248
00:13:48,340 --> 00:13:52,040
I knew you'd been hiding something for a long time now.

249
00:13:52,600 --> 00:13:54,440
A part of you that you couldn't show to anyone,

250
00:13:54,700 --> 00:13:55,500
not even me.

251
00:13:56,880 --> 00:13:58,800
Yami felt the same way, I'm certain.

252
00:13:58,800 --> 00:14:03,360
Perhaps Weigolion saw your true form before his defeat.

253
00:14:04,140 --> 00:14:06,080
That must have come as quite a shock for him.

254
00:14:07,400 --> 00:14:09,520
The day the royal capital was attacked

255
00:14:09,520 --> 00:14:10,960
by the Eye of the Midnight Sun,

256
00:14:11,520 --> 00:14:13,180
the profound unease I felt

257
00:14:13,180 --> 00:14:14,620
when I was confronted by Licht.

258
00:14:15,420 --> 00:14:17,860
I was struck by the familiar air of his mana,

259
00:14:18,380 --> 00:14:19,580
and I couldn't help but notice

260
00:14:19,580 --> 00:14:21,060
that you made yourself scarce

261
00:14:21,060 --> 00:14:22,440
after I injured his hand.

262
00:14:22,820 --> 00:14:24,760
Naturally, my suspicions began to grow.

263
00:14:25,540 --> 00:14:28,140
Yet I told myself it couldn't possibly be true.

264
00:14:28,140 --> 00:14:30,060
I trusted you, after all.

265
00:14:30,320 --> 00:14:32,000
But now I've witnessed the truth.

266
00:14:32,580 --> 00:14:34,140
You and William are not the same,

267
00:14:34,320 --> 00:14:36,260
but rather two souls and one body.

268
00:14:37,280 --> 00:14:38,380
In that sense,

269
00:14:38,800 --> 00:14:40,520
I suppose I wasn't betrayed.

270
00:14:42,500 --> 00:14:44,860
How did you get rid of the scars on your face?

271
00:14:45,200 --> 00:14:46,400
It didn't seem to be magic.

272
00:14:47,540 --> 00:14:49,340
The scars belong only to William,

273
00:14:49,720 --> 00:14:51,300
the mark of a curse he inherited

274
00:14:51,300 --> 00:14:53,040
from his mother's side of the family.

275
00:14:53,740 --> 00:14:55,380
But even if I share this body,

276
00:14:55,380 --> 00:14:57,760
a human's curse has nothing to do with me.

277
00:14:58,140 --> 00:15:00,760
In fact, I despise humans.

278
00:15:01,980 --> 00:15:02,960
William, of course,

279
00:15:03,580 --> 00:15:04,800
is the sole exception.

280
00:15:05,900 --> 00:15:07,100
We were able to coexist

281
00:15:07,100 --> 00:15:09,040
in the same body, after all.

282
00:15:09,760 --> 00:15:10,980
He may have been human,

283
00:15:11,100 --> 00:15:12,600
but he accepted my feelings.

284
00:15:13,200 --> 00:15:14,440
He understood me.

285
00:15:15,660 --> 00:15:17,060
My boundless fury,

286
00:15:17,400 --> 00:15:17,780
sorrow,

287
00:15:18,520 --> 00:15:18,900
hatred,

288
00:15:19,700 --> 00:15:20,540
all of it.

289
00:15:20,540 --> 00:15:23,200
We're like this bird.

290
00:15:23,300 --> 00:15:24,120
It's not strong,

291
00:15:24,240 --> 00:15:25,580
but it can do something special.

292
00:15:26,100 --> 00:15:26,780
It can fly.

293
00:15:27,300 --> 00:15:28,080
As for us,

294
00:15:28,480 --> 00:15:30,260
we have special magic powers

295
00:15:30,260 --> 00:15:31,340
that the humans envy,

296
00:15:31,500 --> 00:15:32,860
so they want to cause us pain.

297
00:15:33,220 --> 00:15:34,080
Still, I think

298
00:15:34,080 --> 00:15:36,120
we may be able to understand

299
00:15:36,120 --> 00:15:37,400
each other better someday.

300
00:15:37,400 --> 00:15:39,760
How wrong I was.

301
00:15:41,820 --> 00:15:43,680
I admit I was a bit surprised.

302
00:15:43,860 --> 00:15:44,700
I didn't think your brother

303
00:15:44,700 --> 00:15:46,120
would feel the same way as me.

304
00:15:46,440 --> 00:15:48,240
We both feel strongly about it.

305
00:15:48,580 --> 00:15:50,240
I know it won't happen overnight,

306
00:15:50,480 --> 00:15:51,760
but I hope elves and humans

307
00:15:51,760 --> 00:15:52,740
can live in harmony.

308
00:15:53,280 --> 00:15:53,860
If not,

309
00:15:54,020 --> 00:15:54,940
