310
00:15:55,240 --> 00:15:56,080
Don't worry.

311
00:15:56,080 --> 00:15:59,360
We're proof that it can happen, right?

312
00:16:00,460 --> 00:16:00,900
Yeah.

313
00:16:00,900 --> 00:16:04,940
If only I'd never met those humans.

314
00:16:06,940 --> 00:16:08,500
