327
00:16:34,600 --> 00:16:36,420
I believe the remaining stones

328
00:16:36,420 --> 00:16:37,400
are in your possession.

329
00:16:39,080 --> 00:16:40,360
We thought that would be

330
00:16:40,360 --> 00:16:41,740
the safest course of action.

331
00:16:42,840 --> 00:16:44,960
I will attain those stones now

332
00:16:44,960 --> 00:16:46,580
and bring our hopes to fruition.

333
00:16:49,620 --> 00:16:50,620
I understand.

334
00:16:51,320 --> 00:16:53,240
You've always had such a kind heart.

335
00:16:54,160 --> 00:16:55,460
Your dear friend is in pain

336
00:16:55,460 --> 00:16:56,420
and you'd do anything

337
00:16:56,420 --> 00:16:57,580
to ease his suffering,

338
00:16:57,760 --> 00:16:58,500
wouldn't you, William?

339
00:16:58,500 --> 00:17:01,300
But you must be suffering as well.

340
00:17:01,920 --> 00:17:02,860
And just as your friend

341
00:17:02,860 --> 00:17:03,760
relied on you,

342
00:17:03,880 --> 00:17:05,220
you can rely on me.

343
00:17:05,840 --> 00:17:07,580
I'm always on your side.

344
00:17:09,300 --> 00:17:11,020
That's why I will bring an end

345
00:17:11,020 --> 00:17:12,240
to this no matter what.

346
00:17:13,660 --> 00:17:15,300
You may believe what you like,

347
00:17:15,520 --> 00:17:16,620
but his heart and mine

348
00:17:16,620 --> 00:17:17,800
are one on this matter.

349
00:17:18,440 --> 00:17:19,420
Now, Wizard King,

350
00:17:19,740 --> 00:17:21,560
I think it's time for you to die.

351
00:17:21,560 --> 00:17:23,820
As the most powerful mage

352
00:17:23,820 --> 00:17:24,480
in this nation,

353
00:17:24,880 --> 00:17:26,320
you must bear its sins.

354
00:17:27,140 --> 00:17:28,560
The crimes that were committed

355
00:17:28,560 --> 00:17:29,420
by its people

356
00:17:29,420 --> 00:17:31,820
will be paid for in your blood.

357
00:17:34,000 --> 00:17:35,700
Light creation magic.

358
00:17:36,420 --> 00:17:37,980
Light swords of conviction.

359
00:17:38,740 --> 00:17:39,340
Monozone.

360
00:17:39,600 --> 00:17:40,900
Chronostasis Gregora.

361
00:17:40,900 --> 00:17:50,280
Light magic may be fast.

362
00:17:50,540 --> 00:17:51,580
Faster than other magic,

363
00:17:51,720 --> 00:17:52,080
certainly.

364
00:17:52,440 --> 00:17:53,420
But that's not to say

365
00:17:53,420 --> 00:17:54,820
there's no defense against it.

366
00:17:59,440 --> 00:18:00,600
Very good.

367
00:18:01,100 --> 00:18:02,860
But even that has its limits.

368
00:18:02,860 --> 00:18:11,180
This man's magic

369
00:18:11,180 --> 00:18:12,820
